	(descr "Johanson 2450AT07A0100001T 2.4 GHz chip antenna, 1.00 x 0.50 x 0.37 mm, 4 terminals (1 Feed, 2 GND, 3 GND, 4 Feed), DS Ver 3.1 test-board lands 0.20 x 0.30. D90 variant (floorplan v4): no edge strip, no all-layer keep-out; the board carries the D90 voids as rule areas WIFI_VOID_V1 (B/In4/In3, 2.6 x 1.6, starts 0.30 mm beside pins 2/3), WIFI_VOID_V2_L2/_L3 (In1/In2, body + 0.3), WIFI_FAR_F, and WIFI_GND_LINK (<= 0.3 mm B.Cu GND link from pins 2/3 to the V1 edge, GND vias just outside V1), research/ANTENNA-WIFI.md 6.4 and 9. GND row toward the board edge, feed inboard.")
